<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>🛡️ 資安威脅情資日報目錄</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
<style>
  body { padding-left: 0; }
  .index-wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
<div class="header-inner">
  <div class="header-brand">
    <div class="header-icon">🛡️</div>
    <div>
      <div class="header-title">資安威脅情資日報</div>
      <div class="header-sub">Cyber Threat Intelligence Daily Report</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="header-meta">
    <span class="badge badge-live">LIVE THREAT FEED</span>
  </div>
</div>
</header>

<main class="index-wrap">
<aside class="tree-sidebar" style="position:static; width:100%; height:auto; border-right:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); box-shadow:none; margin-bottom:24px;">
  <div class="tree-header">
    <span>📑 日報索引目錄</span>
    <span class="badge badge-date">NAV TREE</span>
  </div>
  <ul class="tree-list">
    {% for month in months %}
    <li class="tree-month-node is-open">
      <a class="tree-month-header">{{ month.label }}</a>
      <ul class="tree-day-list">
        {% for day in month.days %}
        <li><a class="tree-day-link" href="{{ day }}.html">{{ day }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</aside>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-logo">🛡️ 資安威脅情資日報</div>
  <div class="footer-text">本報告彙整自公開威脅情資來源，經 LLM 自動摘要產生<br>僅供資安專業人員參考</div>
  <div class="footer-tlp">TLP:CLEAR — 可自由分享</div>
</footer>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  document.querySelectorAll('.tree-month-header').forEach(header => {
    header.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      header.closest('.tree-month-node').classList.toggle('is-open');
    });
  });
});
</script>

</body>
</html>
